## Troubleshooting

| Problem                                             | Fix                                                                                   |
| --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `FileNotFoundError: Crop_recommendation.csv`        | Make sure the CSV is at `backend/data/Crop_recommendation.csv`                        |
| `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'flask_cors'` | `pip install flask-cors`                                                              |
| Frontend shows "Error: Failed to fetch"             | Make sure `python app.py` is running and check `API_BASE_URL` in `script.js`          |
| CORS error in browser console                       | `flask-cors` is already enabled in `app.py` — make sure you didn't remove `CORS(app)` |
| Model file not found when starting `app.py`         | Run `train_federated_iid.py` (or `train_all.py`) first — it creates `models/*.pth`    |
